  "invariants": [
    "Do not load React specialists unless React or Next is the actual target.",
    "Do not load shadcn unless the project uses it or it was intentionally selected.",
    "Do not load Scroll Craft for ordinary application screens.",
    "Do not prototype micro changes.",
    "Do not create or rewrite DESIGN.md for a tiny one-off fix.",
    "Do not change the implementation stack merely because a specialist is installed.",
    "Do not load all experts into one context.",
    "Do not run the originality gate as a novelty requirement for exact-reference recreation or established-product maintenance.",
    "Do not require a decorative signature interaction for dashboards, admin tools, settings, CRUD or other utility applications.",
    "Do not add an experience curve to ordinary CRUD, routine dashboard inspection, settings, simple search/filtering or micro changes.",
    "Do not force scroll-specific QA infrastructure onto ordinary interfaces whose scroll is only document overflow."
  ]
